Usage: ccsh [-hiv] [COMMAND]
Command Line Interface for CodeCharta analysis
  -h, --help          displays this help and exit
  -i, --interactive   starts interactive analyser
  -v, --version       prints version info and exits
Commands:
  check                 validates cc.json files
  inspect               prints the structure of cc.json files
  convert               converts cc.json files to the latest 2.0 {meta, files,
                          lenses} format
  gate                  [experimental] checks a project against the metric and
                          cycle rules in its .codecharta.yml
  analyse               maps a codebase with every applicable parser and its
                          git or svn history
  merge                 merges multiple cc.json files
  edgefilter            aggregates edgeAttributes as nodeAttributes into a new
                          cc.json file
  modify                changes the structure of cc.json files
  csvimport             generates cc.json from csv with header
  sonarimport           generates cc.json from metric data from SonarQube
  sourcemonitorimport   generates cc.json from sourcemonitor csv
  svnlogparser          generates cc.json from svn log file
  gitlogparser          generates cc.json from git-log files
  install               [deprecated]: does nothing
  csvexport             generates csv file with header
  coverageimport        generates cc.json from coverage reports
  codemaatimport        generates cc.json from codemaat coupling csv
  tokeiimporter         generates cc.json from tokei json
  dependachartaimport   [deprecated: use dependencyparser] generates cc.json
                          from DependaCharta .dc.json files
  rawtextparser         generates cc.json from projects or source code files
  unifiedparser         generates cc.json from projects or source code files
  domainlanguageparser  generates cc.json with a domain-language word-frequency
                          lens from source code
  dependencyparser      [experimental] generates cc.json with a file- and
                          declaration-level dependency lens from source code
